<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37161" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέργω</span></b> , 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξείργω</span></b> , fut.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-είρξω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					825
				</span></i>
			:—<i>shut out from</i> a place, <i>debar,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξέργειν τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.51
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξείργειν τινὰ χθονός, γῆς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Heracl.</u>
				20
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξ ἀγορᾶς, ἐκ τοῦ ἄστεος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				936c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ βήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.32
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τῶν ἱερῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lys.
					6.16
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ θεάτρου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.178
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. θύραζε</span>
			<i>drive away and shut</i> him <i>out</i> of doors, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				825
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.169
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξείργεσθαι πάντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.13
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξειργόμενοι δίκης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Rom.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>prevent, preclude,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καιρὸν ἐ. λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					1292
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶνδ᾽ οὐδὲν ἐξείργει νόμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					176
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. δέει τὸ δίκην λαμβάνειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					21.124
				</span></i>
			: abs., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅταν μὴ ἡ ὥρα τοῦ ἔτους ἐξείργῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					4.13
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολέμοις ἐξειργόμενοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.118
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐὰν μὴ χρόνῳ ἐξείργηται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Cat.</u>
					13a31
				</span></i>
			: c. inf., <i>to be hindered from</i> doing,
				<i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Th.</u>
				15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>constrain, compel,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινὰ πληγαῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					935c
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγκαίῃ ἐξέργεσθαι ἔς τι</span>
			<i>to be constrained</i> by necessity to undertake a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.96
			</span></i>: c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναγκαίῃ ἐ.
				γνώμην ἀποδέξασθαι</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				139
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπὸ τοῦ νόμου ἐξεργόμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					9.111
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νόμῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.70
				</span></i>
			.</div>
